# Oracle sweep output
oracle*.csv

# Market data store (root only: src/tradingvision/data/ is a package). 15 GB of Parquet and
# tensors, rebuilt by `python -m tradingvision.data.binance` and the pipeline, never committed.
# `/data/*` and not `/data/`: git does not descend into an ignored directory, so a trailing slash
# would make the two exceptions below unreachable.
/data/*
# The exceptions are the trained checkpoints, and they are here because the deployed artefact
# needs them. The Render image builds from this repo and mounts no disk, so a model that is not
# committed is a page with the prediction toggles permanently off. 106 KB for both, and each one
# carries its own label, branch and normalisation statistics, so neither can be read against the
# wrong target by accident.
!/data/gru.pt
!/data/swing.pt

# Local dev launch config
/.claude/
